    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3f0313aa77fa4dbf",
      "translationZh": "Granite-4.2-30B 是 Granite 4.2 系列中的旗舰推理模型。它利用内置的 <think>...</think> 思维链，在推理密集型任务中提供最强的性能。它支持灵活的思考模式——完整思考（默认）、不思考和低投入——让用户能够针对每次查询，在思考深度与延迟之间取得平衡。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9b377f0649f0c8da",
      "translationZh": "内置推理：原生思维链，可显著提升数学、编程和复杂多步骤问题上的表现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "86e384f107d65df9",
      "translationZh": "灵活的思考模式：在单一模型内无缝切换完整思考、不思考和低投入模式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8ce3855a07f2f087",
      "translationZh": "推理增强的工具调用：模型会推理应该调用哪些工具以及调用的原因，从而生成更准确的函数调用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1025786fdec7999f",
      "translationZh": "512K 上下文窗口：支持长文档、多轮对话和复杂的智能体工作流。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1f7979fbd2001a72",
      "translationZh": "采用 Apache 2.0 许可证：完全开放，可用于商业和研究用途。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b3aa5569021384e4",
      "translationZh": "Granite-4.2-30B 基于仅解码器的稠密 Transformer 架构构建，包含以下核心组件：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "952b43de4e099168",
      "translationZh": "注意力：分组查询注意力（GQA），具有 32 个注意力头和 8 个 KV 头。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "191e90091fe99ce4",
      "translationZh": "位置嵌入：旋转位置嵌入（RoPE），θ = 10,000,000",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9bd423f5884e8628",
      "translationZh": "前馈：采用 SwiGLU 激活函数的 MLP（隐藏层大小为 32768）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "96fb66172646e2e0",
      "translationZh": "归一化：RMSNorm（ε = 1e-5）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e15825b20e856e8",
      "translationZh": "嵌入：输入/输出嵌入相互独立（不共享权重）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c67dcc7d4db4a4c9",
      "translationZh": "Granite-4.2-8B 是 Granite 4.2 系列中的中等规模推理模型。它利用内置的 <think>...</think> 思维链，在推理密集型任务上表现出色。它支持灵活的思考模式——完整思考（默认）、不思考和低投入——让用户能够针对每次查询，在思考深度与延迟之间进行权衡。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e0699a009ee0e80e",
      "translationZh": "Granite-4.2-3B 是 Granite 4.2 系列中的小型推理模型。尽管参数量较小，它仍利用内置的 <think>...</think> 思维链，在推理密集型任务上表现出色。它支持灵活的思考模式——完整思考（默认）、不思考和低投入——让用户能够针对每次查询，在思考深度与延迟之间进行权衡。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
